302	    /**
303	     * The owner's fiscal year, formatted {@code FY<YY>} where {@code YY} is the last two digits of
304	     * the calendar year in which the fiscal year containing the {@code registrationDate} began (the
305	     * fiscal year starts on 1 July; e.g. a registration on 2026-08-11 yields {@code FY26}). Derived
306	     * from the (business-day-adjusted) {@code registrationDate}; {@code null} until it is assigned.
307	     */
