318	     * the last two digits of the fiscal year of the {@code registrationDate} (the fiscal year
319	     * starts on 1 July; e.g. {@code NSW-1A2B3C4D-M26}). Derived from the owner's own fields;
320	     * {@code null} until both are assigned.
321	     */
