426	    /**
427	     * The owner's timezone as an IANA name, derived from its {@link #getLocality() locality} (the
428	     * region) via the fixed region-to-timezone table: {@code NSW->Australia/Sydney},
429	     * {@code VIC->Australia/Melbourne}, {@code QLD->Australia/Brisbane}. Returns {@code null} when
430	     * the locality is not one of those regions.
431	     */
432	    @Transient
